{
  "comment": "Every stable Minecraft release the mod is compiled and checked against, oldest first, with the compat/ source variant it builds with. scripts/build-minecraft-autolan-mod.mjs groups consecutive releases whose compiled jars are identical into one jar. 1.14.4 is the floor: Mojang's official names start there, and Sei's setup only builds Fabric profiles for 1.14 and newer. `ceiling` is the exclusive upper bound of the newest jar, so a hotfix of the newest verified release (26.3.1) is covered but the next feature release is not until it is added here and rebuilt.",
